task.en:
Suppose you implement the postfix ++ as follows:
```cpp
Rational Rational::operator++(int dummy)
{
  Rational temp(*this);
  add(Rational(1, 0));
  return temp;
}
```
Is this implementation correct? If so, compare it with the implementation in the text; which one is better?

